  "description": "Non-material amendments to planning permission reference 24/4057/FUL dated 22/04/25 for 'Large Scale Purpose Built Shared Living (sui generis use) led development, proposals include demolition of the existing buildings, erection of 3 blocks of between 6 and 9 Storeys connected by a 2 storey central building, 331 Shared Living residential units with ancillary communal facilities and amenity spaces to be located at upper floors, flexible town centre (Class E use) units and a drinking establishment (sui generis use) are proposed at ground floor alongside cycle parking, 2x accessible parking bays, and mechanical plant.' Amendments include: Changes to layouts; Repositioning of entrance lobby; Recessed entrances to provide covered canopy; Additional refuse store; Changes to plant rooms and cycle stores; Revision to gym access including provision of secondary means of escape to the rear; Provision of level access to secondary fire escape to commercial unit; Alterations to south-east commercial unit; Changes to first floor amenity spaces; Amendments to service riser; Revision of rooflights; Extension of stair to roof; Addition of airbricks; Alterations to external finishes",
